msgstr ""

#: processes/process/render-kg-to-cdn.bpmn:44
#. Diagram label
msgid "Determine which CDN, the root URL and the Subgraphs"
msgstr ""

#: processes/process/render-kg-to-cdn.bpmn:45
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Every Subgraph id asked for must be one the declaration lists; none means the whole graph. The root URL is the one given. The target's Tool is the one that `satisfies: [\"render-kg-to-cdn\"]` for that CDN — `gh-pages` for GitHub Pages. A caller that already rendered and verified its tree hands the tree over instead of the graph, and the Tool pushes it without rendering again."
msgstr ""

